        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "oJN0h",
          "name": "Behavior and localization contract",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fill_container",
          "gap": 32,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "nSGGS",
              "name": "Window and context behavior",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "o0z85h",
                  "name": "窗口、数据与上下文",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "content": "窗口、数据与上下文",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Ze4EG",
                  "name": "•  重复打开同一数据库时，聚焦已有窗口；窗口间的查询、结果和事务独立。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  顶部页签代表脚本 Session。每个 Session 有自己的脚本、数据库范围和查询历史。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "TDMmm",
                  "name": "•  Session 可添加数据库。数据库目录和添加弹窗都支持多选、全选。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  Session 只纳入当前实例的数据库。添加弹窗固定显示实例信息，并支持多选、全选。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "C6rXa",
                  "name": "•  AI 对话按查询页签隔离；切换页签后切换对应会话。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  查询历史按 Session 隔离，包含该 Session 在各执行目标上的记录；主窗体不聚合历史。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "FUujH",
                  "name": "•  窗口较窄时可收起对象树；AI 面板可独立关闭，编辑器与结果区可拖动分隔线。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  AI 只能访问当前 Session 纳入的数据库。切换 Session 时切换 AI 上下文与对话。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "owPhm",
                  "name": "•  模型请求取消或失败时保留提问草稿；数据库上下文变化后，旧建议需重新审阅。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  数据库范围与执行目标是两个概念。每次执行明确目标；查看表数据后可返回原脚本。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zEJWd",
                  "name": "•  数据库标签上的 × 用于移出 Session；不会删除数据库，也不影响其他 Session。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  数据库标签上的 × 用于移出 Session；不会删除数据库，也不影响其他 Session。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "STpb6",
                  "name": "•  至少保留一个数据库。最后一个的移除入口禁用，并说明原因。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  至少保留一个数据库，末项移除入口禁用；新建 Session 时未选择数据库则不可打开。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ewzg1",
                  "name": "•  移除当前执行目标前，先明确切换至另一个已纳入的数据库；脚本和历史保留。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  移除当前执行目标前，先明确切换至另一个已纳入的数据库；脚本和历史保留。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "ib9Em",
              "name": "Sharing and language contract",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "BZvI1",
                  "name": "发送内容与多语言",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "content": "发送内容与多语言",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "coxqA",
                  "name": "•  上下文展示目标数据库、SQL 方言、页签与表结构；发送前可查看内容清单。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  AI 面板展示当前 Session、纳入的数据库和 SQL 方言；可按需读取范围内的表结构。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "yZDeQ",
                  "name": "•  当前 SQL 可取消附带；结果样本默认关闭。开启时最多 20 行、16 列、8 KiB。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  当前 SQL 可取消附带；结果样本默认关闭。开启时最多 20 行、16 列、8 KiB。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "NhAVg",
                  "name": "•  AI 建议不会自动执行。插入编辑器保留人工修改；审阅并执行使用当前页签连接。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  AI 建议不会自动执行。插入后可修改；审阅弹窗显示 Session、执行目标和完整 SQL。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dp916",
                  "name": "•  会话不持久化；模型服务与参数在系统设置配置，API Key 仅驻留进程内存。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  会话不持久化；模型服务与参数在系统设置配置，API Key 仅驻留进程内存。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ZY2Pq",
                  "name": "•  界面提供 en / zh-Hans，默认跟随 Windows 显示语言；缺失翻译回退英文。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  界面提供 en / zh-Hans，默认跟随 Windows 显示语言；缺失翻译回退英文。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gLIbS",
                  "name": "•  新增文案使用共享资源；SQL、对象名称和服务器返回值保留原文。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  新增文案使用共享资源；SQL、对象名称和服务器返回值保留原文。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "j468o4",
                  "name": "•  数据库移出后，AI 后续请求不再访问它；范围变化使旧执行建议需要重新审阅。",
                  "fill": "#192434",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 744,
                  "content": "•  数据库移出后，AI 后续请求不再访问它；范围变化使旧执行建议需要重新审阅。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
